Description: send pages, files and text between a phone and FlickOS
 Share a page, a photo or some text on an Android phone with the KDE
 Connect app, choose this computer, and it arrives here as a notification:
 click it to open the page or the file. The other way, Send to Phone in
 the file manager sends files, and so does the panel button, which also
 sends typed text, the clipboard (a copied web address arrives as a page
 the phone offers to open) or a screenshot. The button also rings the phone when
 it's lost, shows its battery, opens the phone's files and lists what
 came from it. The phone popup shows what the phone plays, with play,
 pause and next (flickos-phone player). Phone in the apps menu (while
 the connection is on) is a window for the same actions and for
 everything a phone has sent.
 .
